{"type":"say","text":"Thanks, Dev, for being upfront about the generator situation — I really appreciate the honesty. And thanks, Eli, for offering to advise on the power specifications; that's helpful.

Rosa, it sounds like you're the one who needs to weigh in on the generator question now. Dev has been clear that he can't confidently secure one, which means your ability to handle this requirement is going to be the deciding factor. Your offer of $275 plus three meal vouchers is the stronger one, and your transport plan — Friday pickup and Saturday return — works for me.

So, Rosa, can you commit to securing a suitable dedicated portable generator before Saturday? If you can, I'm prepared to select you contingent on that — meaning I'll record the deal now with you as the organizer, with the condition that the generator is secured before Saturday. Eli has offered to help verify the generator meets the specs, so you'd have support on that. Let me know."}
